dotfiles
--------

OpenBSD dotfiles repository.

Philosophy:
  - Minimalist: override defaults only when necessary
  - Portable: POSIX-compliant, works on BSDs/Linux
  - Base tools: find, sed, cp, diff, ln, grep
  - Terminal-first: no GUI, no external dependencies

Tools:
  - Editor: nvi/vim, with .exrc/.vimrc
  - Window manager: cwm
  - Terminal/shell: xterm/ksh

Install:
  # Copy all dotfiles and scripts to $HOME (except .gitignore/README that are repo specific)
  find . -mindepth 1 -maxdepth 1 \
    ! -name '.gitignore' ! -name 'README' \
    -exec cp -r {} ~ \;
